You create a psionic shield from your weapon that prevents you from ever taking blows that deal more than [94%, 88%, 82%, 76%, 70% (TL1-5)] of your maximum life and gives you [3%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 14% (TL1-5)] evasion.

In addition, each time you take a melee hit the attacker automatically takes revenge strike that deals [37%, 45%, 50%, 55%, 60% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as mind damage. (This effect can only happen once per turn)

If you do not have a two handed weapon equiped, but have it in your off set, you instantly automatically switch.
